{"v3_839a55e5a287c0f2faeee0a9":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは~"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"櫻坂46 四期生 山田桃実(やまだももみ)です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobHj33HX.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Sakurazaka46 ARENA TOUR 2026 -What's lonesome？-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて、6都市12公演ありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回四期生は初めて全公演回らせていただき、31人、1人も欠けることなく完走できたツアーでした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何を目標として、何を得るのか\n自問自答を繰り返しました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかし、公演を重ねていくうちに難しく考えすぎても素直にライブを楽しめないと思ってきて、やっぱり皆さんと一緒に全力で楽しむことが一番だと気づき、毎公演自分史上一番のパフォーマンスをするようにしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして1番思ったのは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"貴方の人生に櫻坂46がいることが嬉しい、ということです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうして巡り会えていることって、きっと高い確率ではないと思うんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"各地の会場に行くごとに、同じ時間を同じ空間で過ごしている、これって凄いことだなって思いながら会場を見渡していました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"貴方と出会えて嬉しいです\n私はとても幸せです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、いつも照らしてくださりありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私がステージに立つ理由がBuddiesの皆さんに詰まっています"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな時も私にはBuddiesがいる、だから頑張れる\n大事で大切な、光源です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもずっと一緒にいてください、見ていてくださいというのは少しおこがましい気もしますが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いてくれると嬉しいな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばるから、がんばれるから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からもまた、一緒に歩いていこうね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobnG893m.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1着目"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobvW7XxE.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2着目\nなんかぶれてた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白い衣装も含めて、全部それぞれかわいいかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mob54xvLg.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うどん脳さんたち\nうどん食べすぎてうどん脳になったらしいんだけど\nわたしもそのうちなるのかな、食べすぎて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobVsjHz2.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うどんソファ\n寝れます、ここ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobkHEPRk.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うどんやどんうどんやどん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobmypvWS.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/moby1CfcM.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"p